<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally higher on fairly good demand and mostly moderate offerings. Select rib, chuck, round and loin cuts higher while the Choice cuts generally firm. Beef trimmings higher on slow developing demand on mostly moderate offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>----</p>
<p>303 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 86 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>69 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     100.24	100.02	 95.90	 95.18</p>
<p>Changes	   0.43	  0.66	  1.39	  0.83</p>
<p>Rib	  158.47	157.01	153.23	152.55</p>
<p>Chuck	 68.09	 67.32	 70.78	 68.48</p>
<p>Round	 85.81	 85.81	 84.48	 84.48</p>
<p>Loin	 158.55	159.41	138.34	138.54</p>
